{"availability":"available","full":"isaact/vue-infinity","name":"vue-infinity","description":"Vue Infinity is a lightweight library for creating resource efficient apps. Unload parts of your UI when not visible and build easy to layout virtual scrollers that can present unlimited content while keeping resource usage fixed.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Vue","stars":151,"forks":1,"created":"2025-04-22T15:38:57Z","updated":"2026-07-21T14:11:09Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tewolde.co/vueInfinity/","topics":["memory-ef","virtual-scroll","vue"],"demo":"https://tewolde.co/vueInfinity/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T14:59:34.126Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T14:59:34.126Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T14:59:34.126Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:18:47.864Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Vue","url":"https://github.com/vuejs/awesome-vue"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:18:47.864Z","stars":151,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T14:59:34.126Z","stars":151,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Build lightning-fast Vue apps that only render what is on-screen","Vue-Infinity brings a radical efficiency boost to your UI by applying the same principle that powers 3D engines: if it’s not in visible, it doesn’t get rendered. This lets your app handle hundreds or thousands of elements without bloating memory, janking or killing batteries.","Whether you’re building infinite feeds, carousels, media galleries, or dashboards—Vue-Infinity keeps your app fast, smooth, and efficient."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/isaact/vue-infinity/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f6c7bedaabd94fca91e6dcd796d14a05a2e8f38d7c9c2d2a701fce5fbd852d26","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:18:47.864Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:18:47.864Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Build lightning-fast Vue apps that only render wha